id: long-press-text-field
section: Chrome, menus and dialogs
item: Hold on text and on a field: the daemon sees a hold (editable 0, then 1) and the card's menu comes up over the page; a tap outside takes it away and a plain tap afterwards is unaffected
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-card-events.html
kit: cavekit-ui-shell.md R7
calibrate bar
sample page 0,100,756,600
hold-on near
wait differs 0,100,756,600 page 5
shoot hold-text
dismiss 640 960
wait still 0,100,756,600 5
hold-on field
wait line 'hold at .* editable=1' 6
shoot hold-field
dismiss 640 500
wait still 0,100,400,240 5
tap away
wait load 30
expect url jihad-long-static
